{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A COZY EXPLORATION PLATFORMER ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/bf13305ec2ac0b2d4392a933461e8103.poster.avif?t=1768846478\" width=616 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/bf13305ec2ac0b2d4392a933461e8103.webm?t=1768846478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ILA\u2019s beloved kitty,\u00a0<strong>Coco</strong>, has\u00a0<strong>mysteriously disappeared</strong>, and she\u2019s determined to\u00a0<strong>bring him back home!\u00a0</strong>Explore a whimsical small open world as ILA, a spirited young witch-in-training flying on a magic Skatebroom. Uncover hidden stories, collect valuable items, and improve your magical flying abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GLIDE AROUND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/d728462facae30a0893ef5cb74451f70.poster.avif?t=1768846478\" width=616 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/d728462facae30a0893ef5cb74451f70.webm?t=1768846478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you ever dreamed of flying on a skateboard?</strong>\u00a0Feel the wind as you glide effortlessly through the crisp mountain air on Ila\u2019s magical skatebroom as you explore the enchanting island.\u00a0The core mechanic focuses on the\u00a0<strong>pure joy of movement.</strong> Master and upgrade your flying skills, soar to new heights and tackle thrilling platforming challenges along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER THE STORY OF ILA AND THE ISLAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/245fddd9b4cc1d465262841d9d1fa90d.poster.avif?t=1768846478\" width=616 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/245fddd9b4cc1d465262841d9d1fa90d.webm?t=1768846478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the rich lore of the island as you\u00a0<strong>uncover ancient secrets</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>forgotten stories</strong>. Piece together the history of the land and its connection to Ila\u2019s past, revealing surprising\u00a0<strong>ties between her dreams and the mysteries\u00a0</strong>of this enchanted place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND SECRET PLACES AND RELAX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/bd79e310a3436911cbd1793c8d00359e.poster.avif?t=1768846478\" width=616 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/bd79e310a3436911cbd1793c8d00359e.webm?t=1768846478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ILA\u2019s magical island at your own pace and relax. <strong>Find hidden nooks and uncovered treasures</strong> flying on your skatebroom. But also endulge yourself p<strong>ausing and enjoying the view</strong>\u00a0from\u00a0high vantage points. Savor the\u00a0<strong>serene beauty</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>tranquil freedom</strong>\u00a0of the snow-covered landscape on your magical skatebroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WITCHY CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/d026b7387e80d8388932be84a0dfbb20.poster.avif?t=1768846478\" width=616 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/d026b7387e80d8388932be84a0dfbb20.webm?t=1768846478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your creativity by personalizing ILA\u2019s appearance! Find special items around the island or collect coins to use at the magic shop. Choose from a\u00a0<strong>variety of outfits, hats, capes and skatebrooms</strong>\u00a0to create a unique look that reflects your own style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENJOY THE IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the magic of ILA\u2019s world and enjoy the captivating original soundtrack composed by Joaquim Scandurra (Sku). <strong>Each track evolves with ILA\u2019s adventure inviting you to relax and grows alongside your journey</strong> to guide you toward Coco\u2019s clues with every note. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/2b1581cd9da097dc560f87f5e7d5b2c4.poster.avif?t=1768846478\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/2b1581cd9da097dc560f87f5e7d5b2c4.webm?t=1768846478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/2b1581cd9da097dc560f87f5e7d5b2c4.mp4?t=1768846478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First steps to find Coco","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1560160/0a0dec53a3120ad8be3744009622b62974b327e6.jpg"},{"name":"I\u2019m rich!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1560160/1e9187fbc9874674b3ec33e3d6b670c352d0f767.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1560160/32881a51ff5550239dd03f85b2ef7942fecd852b.jpg"},{"name":"Trend Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1560160/9ccc892667f733c5d9fc66729649cbf87ca1df24.jpg"},{"name":"A Gift from Beyond","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1560160/bd83df6df896aba047cafcd168c80cb451f4019b.jpg"},{"name":"Your loving Dad, Bryn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1560160/2236e41d394d896de51bf2e94d64301df97d3188.jpg"},{"name":"Whisper Tracking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1560160/f1729286c7252b660d8aa7dc009b2b5b89b1b89e.jpg"},{"name":"Making Friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1560160/69ca3c974e1a5ea01f09e70d5b09d34f2c6dde67.jpg"},{"name":"Bonded by Memories","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1560160/31053b3461a001dc9646cc6bb622dc48c284c57d.jpg"},{"name":"Island Lorekeeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1560160/8477c9225fe0a261f5b8cde25c56dc8dbd3f1f9b.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1560160?t=1768846478","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com